<section class="wrap section story" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
  <h2 id="story-heading">Why OpenFader</h2>
  <div class="story-copy">
    <p>I started OpenFader because the mixer apps I tried felt clunky. I wanted to build an app with the quality of a premium product that anyone could use.</p>
    <p>My aim is to make the interface as good as I can: simple for beginners and musicians, with the customization experienced users need. Open source gives people a way to add support for their mixers, so this app can be used by more people.</p>
    <p>The roadmap for this project goes beyond a client app. I want to make virtual soundcheck easier, add automatic feedback reduction, and do much more.</p>
  </div>
</section>
